        "content": {
          "passageId": "english-pre-a1-m017-reading-passage-01",
          "passage": "The weather changes during the week. On Monday it is sunny and warm, so we play outside. On Tuesday it is cloudy and cool. On Wednesday it is rainy, so I take an umbrella. In winter it can be snowy and cold. Sometimes the weather is stormy, with strong wind and rain. I check the weather before I go out."
        },
